OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers back new publicly owned
OL,4,Abuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers have welcomed the return of
OL,7,Fpublicly owned bus services to
OL,8,FMerseyside for the first time since the
OL,9,F1980s.
OL,11,FThe first services launched in St
OL,12,FHelens on Sunday 6 September and will
OL,13,Fexpand to the Wirral later this year.
OL,14,FFull roll-out across the city region is
OL,15,Fexpected by 2027.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
