OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers back new publicly owned
OL,4,Abuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Region secured #86.3m in
OL,7,Fgovernment funding to help roll out the
OL,8,Fscheme. The Department for Transport
OL,9,Fsaid it would give local leaders
OL,10,Fgreater control over routes, branding
OL,11,Fand fares, while helping improve
OL,12,Fservices for passengers.
OL,14,FA new service to Liverpool John Lennon
OL,15,FAirport has launched, as well as an
OL,16,Fearly morning express journey to
OL,17,FSouthport.
